Feel the very existence of creatures around you for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns, in a radius of 10.

The evil touch will reduce their blight resistance by [16%, 22%, 27%, 30%, 34% (TL1-5; SP 100)] and all saves by [28, 38, 46, 52, 58 (TL1-5; SP 100)], but also make them aware of you.

The resistance and save reduction will improve with your Spellpower.
